  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Procurement of Kendall</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Upphandling av Kendall</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kendall &amp; Partners Ltd are engaged through a call-off to prepare a ToR for a new project that continues the reform of the procurement system in Ukraine that Sida has been financing for the past few years, at the same time giving it a new start. Support to carry out the tender process is included. The Ukrainian partner is the Dept of Public Procurement within the Ministry of Economy.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Kendall &amp; Partners Ltd handlas upp genom avrop p&#xe5; ett ramavtal f&#xf6;r att ta fram ToR f&#xf6;r ett projekt som forts&#xe4;tter reformen av upphandlingssystemet i Ukraina, men som ger arbetet en nystart. Uppdraget omfattar &#xe4;ven st&#xf6;d till mottagarlandet att genomf&#xf6;ra sj&#xe4;lva upphandlingen. Motpart i Ukraina &#xe4;r Dept of Public Procurement i ekonomiministeriet.</narrative>
  </description>
